          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kirapas Yoas wero Yeoas pöytoghinto Israel, kuropï Amasya wero Yoas pöytoghinto Yuda kïtöpö könyis taman nko mut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ighisyewut pö Amasya löwïr cho kigh kutorö cho tagh ntökïchini pö löt, kïmekirotcha ompö kitapuna ngala pöghisyewut pö pöytoghi Yuda nko cho pö Israel? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïngeta otini kipïstö Amasya ECHOTYON, kïyar pich or nyo tïgho nyinte ompö Yerusalem, kuperta kïwö Lakis. Wölo keyonta mïrön kïpa Lakis kïrïp nyinte akïtïghchï wölini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kekösönunö portanyi angoletin kutöngwï Yerusalem, aketïpchï wölo kikïtïpchï papotïnechi ompö kanasyanta Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.28"
            ]
          }
        }
